    {
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "<b>tener que</b> is personal and conjugates (tengo que, tienes que ...). <b>hay que</b> is impersonal and never changes.",
        "<b>Negative:</b> <i>No tienes que venir</i> = you do not have to. <i>No debes venir</i> = you should not."
      ]
    },
